I am working on adding support for a micron 2 MP sensor: mt9d111 on a gumsitx overo.  This is a i2c-controlled sensor.  Ideally, I would like to use the omap34xxcam driver to interface with this sensor.  I am wondering if there are currently any distributions which already include support for this sensor through the omap34xxcam driver, or if anyone else is interested in this topic.

